    "text": "1 days ago The San Juan High School girls and boys wrestling teams kick off their seasons on Wednesday, December 3 with a trip to Aztec, New Mexico with action scheduled to start at 5 p.m. The boys team will duel Dolores, CO and Aztec, NM while the girls will take on Aztec. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
